From: Claude <claude@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 22 Sep 2026 22:38:20 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add 'Non Bending' as a Main Sub option for
 profiles/onboarding

Separate from the Damage Calculator's sub elements - this is the SUBS list used in Onboarding, Profile editing, and the Members filter. main_sub is a free-text column with no DB constraint, so no migration needed.
---
 src/lib/supabase.ts | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/src/lib/supabase.ts b/src/lib/supabase.ts
index 8ebd916..7837ff7 100644
--- a/src/lib/supabase.ts
+++ b/src/lib/supabase.ts
@@ -71,6 +71,7 @@ export const SUBS = [
   'Lava',
   'Metal',
   'Sand',
+  'Non Bending',
 ] as const;
 
 export interface DbUser {
